{"story":{"id":"event-ancrel-6150","title":{"zh":"屏障星球","en":"Shielded Planet"},"category":"precursors","kind":"family","image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","start":"ancrel.6150","chapters":12,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"最近的调查显示，[From.GetName]被包围在了一个拥有难以置信的强度并反射所有探测手段的护盾之中。这个星球护盾似乎是从这颗星球附近的卫星中产生的。","en":"As confirmed by its recent survey, [From.GetName] is surrounded by an incredibly strong energy field that deflects all attempts to scan it. The field appears to be generated from the planet's nearby moon."},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"C2 precursor review (resumed, Claude)","scope":{"zh":"整条故事：开端与触发条件、全部文档的先后与互斥关系、结局；相关脚本与中英文正文已读。","en":"Whole story: opening and trigger conditions, order and exclusivity of every doc, endings; the relevant scripts and both languages read."},"sources":["events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt","common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","common/relics/relics.txt","common/on_actions/00_on_actions.txt","common/solar_system_initializers/ancient_relics_initializers.txt","localisation/simp_chinese","localisation/english"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-ancrel-6150.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n12"]},"n1":{"doc":"ancrel.6150","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"CURIOUS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1213"},"children":["n3","n4","n5"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.6155","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:247"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.6160","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:253"},"children":[]},"n5":{"doc":"ancrel.6165","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:259"},"children":["n6"]},"n6":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_2","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"CURIOUS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1340"},"children":["n7","n8","n9","n10"]},"n7":{"doc":"ancrel.6170","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:286"},"children":[]},"n8":{"doc":"ancrel.6175","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:292"},"children":[]},"n9":{"doc":"ancrel.6180","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:298"},"children":[]},"n10":{"doc":"ancrel.6185","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:304"},"children":["n11"]},"n11":{"doc":"ancrel.7007","parent":"n10","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"获得遗珍“微缩星河”后：激活它（可重复）","en":"With the relic \"Miniature Galaxy\": activate it (repeatable)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-ancrel-6150.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"CURIOUS"},"children":[]},"n12":{"doc":"ancrel.6151","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","secondary":true,"triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n13"]},"n13":{"ref":"n2","doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","parent":"n12","via":{"option":"CURIOUS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1246"}}}},"groups":[{"kind":"exclusive","members":["ancrel.6150","ancrel.6151"],"label":{"zh":"先勘察哪一个天体","en":"Which body is surveyed first"},"labels":[{"zh":"先勘察被屏障包裹的行星（再由它找到卫星）","en":"the shielded planet first (it points to the moon)"},{"zh":"先勘察卫星","en":"the moon first"}],"note":{"zh":"两个都在 on_survey_planet 触发，并都检查全局标志 minigalaxy_site_spawned（只会发生一次）：6150 要求被勘察的是 minigalaxy_planet，6151 要求是 minigalaxy_moon。","en":"Both fire from on_survey_planet and both check the global flag minigalaxy_site_spawned (so only one ever happens): 6150 needs the surveyed body to be minigalaxy_planet, 6151 needs minigalaxy_moon."}}],"nodeLabels":{"ancrel.6165":{"zh":"护盾生成器（创建第二个遗址）","en":"The shield generator (creates the second site)"},"ancrel.6185":{"zh":"微缩星河（获得遗珍）","en":"Miniaturized Galaxy (relic gained)"}}},"chapters":[{"id":"ancrel.6150","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"屏障星球","en":"Shielded Planet"},"texts":[{"zh":"最近的调查显示，[From.GetName]被包围在了一个拥有难以置信的强度并反射所有探测手段的护盾之中。这个星球护盾似乎是从这颗星球附近的卫星中产生的。","en":"As confirmed by its recent survey, [From.GetName] is surrounded by an incredibly strong energy field that deflects all attempts to scan it. The field appears to be generated from the planet's nearby moon."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURIOUS","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1213","story":"event-ancrel-6150"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt","line":1171},"sets":["minigalaxy_site_spawned"],"names":{"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"卫星基地","en":"Moon Base"},"texts":[{"zh":"在这颗卫星上的一个大陨石坑内，可以找到一座大型基地建筑群的遗迹。它已经被遗弃了几千年之久。围绕着附近行星的能量屏障似乎是源于这个古老的基地正下方的一个能量源。","en":"Ruins of a large base complex of some kind can be found inside a large crater on this moon. It must have been abandoned thousands of years ago. The energy barrier that encompasses the nearby planet appears to originate from a source directly beneath this ancient base."}],"sections":[{"zh":"在这颗卫星上的一个大陨石坑内，可以找到一座大型基地建筑群的遗迹。它已经被遗弃了几千年之久。围绕着附近行星的能量屏障似乎是源于这个古老的基地正下方的一个能量源。","en":"Ruins of a large base complex of some kind can be found inside a large crater on this moon. It must have been abandoned thousands of years ago. The energy barrier that encompasses the nearby planet appears to originate from a source directly beneath this ancient base."}],"image":"art/d63f9361bc2bc9cdd5ab.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6155","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:247","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.6160","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:253","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.6165","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:259","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29557","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29557","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29557","mo